{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>iPhone 或 iPad 儲存空間經常吃緊，又不願盲目刪除相片，Storage Cleaner 正好切合需要。它在本機掃描相片庫，找出重複與相似的相片和影片、大型影片、螢幕截圖、螢幕錄影及模糊相片，再由用戶自行決定移除哪一項。掃描、檢視與滑動清理均可免費使用，原價 US $9.99 的終生版現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，適合重視私隱、不想把相片上傳到雲端的用戶。</p>\n\n\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-28.webp\"/></figure>\n\n\n<h2>本機掃描重複相片與大檔案</h2>\n\n\n<p>此 App 會在本機掃描相片庫，找出重複與相似的相片和影片，並按大小列出大型影片、螢幕截圖及模糊相片。用戶可逐張滑動決定保留或移除，未經確認不會刪除，每次滑動均可復原。程式亦支援壓縮大型相片與影片並保留日期與相簿分類，以及合併重複聯絡人。</p>\n\n\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-58-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-59-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-60-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-61-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-62-scaled.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-63-scaled.jpg\"/></figure></figure>\n\n\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n\n\n<p>Storage Cleaner: SpaceFresh 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n\n\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Storage Cleaner: SpaceFresh</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/storage-cleaner-spacefresh/id6798147223\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:45.262255+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":493,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:28:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.635100+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.635100+00:00","content_hash":"5f5ae1b20b22d58cc0208c2bca1d3a16beae2385c70ff5ed5b9fa6210f44eaf0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}